{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wanglou-e-72ee6e830a3a41241faf","title":"裴松之按《吴录》王蕃嘲万彧时序乖互","accounts":[{"id":"wanglou-a-72ee6e830a3a41241faf","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之按《吴录》王蕃嘲万彧时序乖互","evidence":["wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","related_events":[{"event":"wanglou-e-6be5f98f67dc8a93c5ab","type":"disputes","evidence":["wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]}],"order":11074},{"id":"wanglou-e-6be5f98f67dc8a93c5ab","title":"《吴录》记王蕃与万彧互嘲；裴注指出其时序不合","accounts":[{"id":"wanglou-a-6be5f98f67dc8a93c5ab","label":"裴注·《吴录》","text":"《吴录》记王蕃与万彧互嘲；裴注指出其时序不合","evidence":["wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0069","role":"嘲讥","evidence":["wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0062","role":"反讥","evidence":["wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4","related_events":[{"event":"wanglou-e-72ee6e830a3a41241faf","type":"disputes","evidence":["wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4"]}],"order":11072}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wanglou-q-469dbb058c9df3da3b77","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-5e574a309008fdcd5dc4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：本传云丁忠使晋还，皓为大会，于会中杀蕃。检忠从北还，在此年之春；彧时尚未为丞相，至秋乃为相耳。《吴录》所言，为乖互不同。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-7edcd423890e0a3377e4","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-8eb1e6186b39a112b4ba","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“皓每于会，因酒酣，辄令侍臣嘲谑公卿，以为笑乐。万彧既为（左）〔右〕丞相，蕃嘲彧曰：‘鱼潜于渊，出水煦沫。何则？物有本性，不可横处非分也！彧出自溪谷，羊质虎皮；虚受光赫之宠，跨越三九之位。犬马犹能识养，将何以报厚施乎？’彧曰：‘唐虞之朝无谬举之才，造父之门无驽蹇之质；蕃上诬明选，下讪桢干：何伤于日月？适（多）见其不知量耳！’”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cde2697c79ac56416fb3","start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
